  "categorias": "Deportes|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>El sal&oacute;n de actos del antiguo colegio Monteblanco&nbsp;acoge hasta este s&aacute;bado el IX Concurso de Palomos de Raza Vila d&#39;Onda, en&nbsp;el que participan ejemplares de tres clases diferentes de toda la Comunitat Valenciana.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/11/IMG_3339.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Durante el lunes y martes se han recibido los palomos participantes, que son enjuiciados por los dos jueces este mi&eacute;rcoles y el jueves por la ma&ntilde;ana.<br />\n Las tardes del jueves y viernes, en horario de 16 a 20 horas, y el s&aacute;bado por la ma&ntilde;ana, de 9 a 13 horas, la exposici&oacute;n estar&aacute; abierta al p&uacute;blico en general y, especialmente, a las personas&nbsp;aficionadas. La clausura y la entrega de premios ser&aacute; el s&aacute;bado, 30 de noviembre,&nbsp;a las 13 horas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscolomsracadimecres/img_3319.jpg\" alt=\"img_3319\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscolomsracadimecres/img_3320.jpg\" alt=\"img_3320\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscolomsracadimecres/img_3321.jpg\" alt=\"img_3321\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscolomsracadimecres/img_3322.jpg\" alt=\"img_3322\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscolomsracadimecres/img_3323.jpg\" alt=\"img_3323\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscolomsracadimecres/img_3324.jpg\" alt=\"img_3324\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscolomsracadimecres/img_3325.jpg\" alt=\"img_3325\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscolomsracadimecres/img_3326.jpg\" alt=\"img_3326\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscolomsracadimecres/img_3327.jpg\" alt=\"img_3327\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscolomsracadimecres/img_3328.jpg\" alt=\"img_3328\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscolomsracadimecres/img_3329.jpg\" alt=\"img_3329\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscolomsracadimecres/img_3330.jpg\" alt=\"img_3330\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscolomsracadimecres/img_3331.jpg\" alt=\"img_3331\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscolomsracadimecres/img_3334.jpg\" alt=\"img_3334\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscolomsracadimecres/img_3338.jpg\" alt=\"img_3338\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscolomsracadimecres/img_3339.jpg\" alt=\"img_3339\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscolomsracadimecres/img_3340.jpg\" alt=\"img_3340\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscolomsracadimecres/img_3341.jpg\" alt=\"img_3341\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
